Flutter 3.47.7 • channel stable (Windows desktop and web).

Which recompiles all default pipelines for every snapshot and onscreen surface.

On Impeller's OpenGL ES backend, `GPUSurfaceGLImpeller` only has a constructor taking `std::shared_ptr<impeller::Context>` and unconditionally allocates a new `AiksContext` on construction:

- `AndroidSurfaceGLImpeller::CreateSnapshotSurface()` creates a new `GPUSurfaceGLImpeller` on every offscreen snapshot when the onscreen `Surface` has not yet been set up on the `Rasterizer`.
- `AndroidSurfaceGLImpeller::CreateGPUSurface()` and `EmbedderSurfaceGLImpeller::CreateGPUSurface()` also create a new `GPUSurfaceGLImpeller` whenever the onscreen surface is created or recreated.

Constructing an `AiksContext` constructs a `ContentContext`, which initializes all the default pipelines.

#### Repro case

When a Flutter app calls `Picture.toImageSync()` during the first frame on the UI thread, `DlDeferredImageGPUImpeller` posts `MakeImpellerSnapshotSync` to the raster thread, which frequently runs before `PlatformViewAndroid::NotifyCreated` sets up the onscreen `Surface` on the `Rasterizer`:

<details>
<summary>Details</summary>
1. **Snapshot 1 (`CreateSnapshotSurface()`)**: `MakeSnapshotContextCurrent` calls `producer->CreateSnapshotSurface()`, which constructs `GPUSurfaceGLImpeller` which constructs the first **`AiksContext`**, compiling all default pipelines.
2. **Additional pre-surface snapshots (`CreateSnapshotSurface()`)**: Because `CreateSnapshotSurface()` returns a temporary `std::unique_ptr<Surface>` that is destroyed at the end of `DoMakeRasterSnapshot`, a second `Picture.toImageSync()` call before the window surface is ready constructs another **`AiksContext`**, recompiling all default pipelines a second time. *(Note: prior to [#194506](https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/194506), even a single `Picture.toImageSync()` call constructed two `AiksContext`s during the snapshot because `DoMakeRasterSnapshot` called both `producer->CreateSnapshotSurface()` and `delegate.GetAiksContext()`.)*
3. **Onscreen surface creation (`CreateGPUSurface()`)**: When `PlatformViewAndroid::NotifyCreated` runs, `AndroidSurfaceGLImpeller::CreateGPUSurface()` constructs another `GPUSurfaceGLImpeller` which creates yet another **`AiksContext`** , compiling all default pipelines a third time.
</details>

